{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 7, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "\"Discovering Japan: A Journey of Culture and Wonder\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the bustling streets of Tokyo to the serene gardens of Kyoto, I was captivated by the country's unique blend of traditional and modern culture.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The sights and smells of the fresh seafood on display were overwhelming, and I was thrilled to try some of the local sushi for breakfast. I also had the opportunity to visit the Meiji Shrine, a beautiful Shinto shrine located in a tranquil forested area.\n\nIn Kyoto, I was struck by the stunning beauty of the Kinkaku-ji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion. The temple's gleaming golden exterior was reflected perfectly in the surrounding pond, creating a breathtaking scene. I also enjoyed strolling through the city's traditional streets, taking in the sights and sounds of the old Japan.\n\nThroughout my trip, I was impressed by the Japanese people's hospitality and respect for tradition. From the polite bowings and greetings to the carefully prepared meals, every aspect of Japanese culture seemed to be infused with a sense of reverence and attention to detail.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was a journey of discovery and wonder. I left with a newfound appreciation for this fascinating country and its rich cultural heritage, and I look forward to returning one day.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -1.4731934070587158}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.009046164341270924}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.029762104153633118}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.0005254556890577078}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -6.198863957251888e-06}, {"token": " Journey", "logprob": -0.03783310204744339}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.021022707